# The default view of a molecule (#227): the style the scene names (Ball And Stick is the default since #227), element colours,
# the viewer's own background unless @BG@ is white.  @SYS@, @STYLE@, @ROT@, @BG@
# are substituted by hand.
labels none
@BG@
style @STYLE@
viewall
rotate @ROT@
viewall
snap warm
snap warm
snap @SYS@-@TAG@
